(6433151, 953944, 96751, '<td valign="top">Love the tones and the circular lines.  Nicely inserted man and dog, although the latter is barely visible.  Could have very easily bumped the exposure a tad to better integrate into the image.  Love the gold tones you gave the turbine.</td>', 'Love the tones and the circular lines.  Nicely inserted man and dog, although the latter is barely visible.  Could have very easily bumped the exposure a tad to better integrate into the image.  Love the gold tones you gave the turbine.', '2011-06-03 12:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
