(6433157, 954971, 96751, '<td valign="top">A wonderful collection of imagery, but I feel like everything is fighting everything else.  Although the otter and owl are center and focused (and adorable), they are also rather camouflaged in the wood and stones due to their coloring;  The bright color of the flowers on the left, and the fact that they are in the foreground, also steal focus, as does the marvelous home in the bg, which is much better lit and occupies almost half of the image.</td>', 'A wonderful collection of imagery, but I feel like everything is fighting everything else.  Although the otter and owl are center and focused (and adorable), they are also rather camouflaged in the wood and stones due to their coloring;  The bright color of the flowers on the left, and the fact that they are in the foreground, also steal focus, as does the marvelous home in the bg, which is much better lit and occupies almost half of the image.', '2011-06-03 12:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
