(6433312, 954575, 112739, '<td valign="top">Packed to the hilt, waver yes, but not quite tilt. Towards an unknown guided path we go, not alone we go holding our memories, hurts, loves, thoughts, and dreams. To an end of which we do not know, boldly, intentionally we must go. 9</td>', 'Packed to the hilt, waver yes, but not quite tilt. Towards an unknown guided path we go, not alone we go holding our memories, hurts, loves, thoughts, and dreams. To an end of which we do not know, boldly, intentionally we must go. 9', '2011-06-03 15:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
