(6433380, 953944, 112739, '<td valign="top">A machine to travel time and space, left me wondering which be the case? My little buddy along for the trip, for the ladies I appear to be more hip. To new and exciting locales we venture, come aboard if you dare, for we need not a map to experience our share.</td>', 'A machine to travel time and space, left me wondering which be the case? My little buddy along for the trip, for the ladies I appear to be more hip. To new and exciting locales we venture, come aboard if you dare, for we need not a map to experience our share.', '2011-06-03 16:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
