(6433394, 955021, 112739, '<td valign="top">Combinations of forgotten presentations. Each alone and not much use, but together creating a new life, like the flow of a river in the spring. Free to move only downward, as gravity takes hold, and moves us forward, always forward.</td>', 'Combinations of forgotten presentations. Each alone and not much use, but together creating a new life, like the flow of a river in the spring. Free to move only downward, as gravity takes hold, and moves us forward, always forward.', '2011-06-03 17:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433405, 954321, 112739, '<td valign="top">I remember a time, filled with laughter and love. How could I know what would come from above? The air filled with fire and I was left to die amoung the dire. I yearn for those bygone days. My life now just a shadow in the haze. To become alive once more, would mean to venture out from beyond this door. I am trapped here with my sin, for God I do not know where to begin. 10</td>', 'I remember a time, filled with laughter and love. How could I know what would come from above? The air filled with fire and I was left to die amoung the dire. I yearn for those bygone days. My life now just a shadow in the haze. To become alive once more, would mean to venture out from beyond this door. I am trapped here with my sin, for God I do not know where to begin. 10', '2011-06-03 17:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433408, 954937, 112739, '<td valign="top">Once known for my looks, condemed now to just read books. Ashamed that I may wither in this state, someone please save me from my fate. Youth is valued as the holy grail, but wisdom valued highest when we become frail.</td>', 'Once known for my looks, condemed now to just read books. Ashamed that I may wither in this state, someone please save me from my fate. Youth is valued as the holy grail, but wisdom valued highest when we become frail.', '2011-06-03 17:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
