(6433506, 954937, 77196, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, but feel like the "older" image could have better editing - especially in the tones. That type of editing is extremely difficult to get it to look right, and you probably spent lots of time on it.</td>', 'I like the concept, but feel like the "older" image could have better editing - especially in the tones. That type of editing is extremely difficult to get it to look right, and you probably spent lots of time on it.', '2011-06-03 20:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433509, 955034, 77196, '<td valign="top">Some excellent editing on this - I especially like the water falling from the book, how you''ve lined up the bowl, sun/moon path, and sun/star. Love the birds in the sky. Not sure I get the red flower/ribbon. Don''t like the stuff coming from her eye - can''t tell if it is supposed to be salt or water. You have several little "touches" here that help glue it all together - her wet hair, for instance.</td>', 'Some excellent editing on this - I especially like the water falling from the book, how you''ve lined up the bowl, sun/moon path, and sun/star. Love the birds in the sky. Not sure I get the red flower/ribbon. Don''t like the stuff coming from her eye - can''t tell if it is supposed to be salt or water. You have several little "touches" here that help glue it all together - her wet hair, for instance.', '2011-06-03 20:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433510, 955059, 77196, '<td valign="top">Not a very exciting image, but very nicely done - just the right amount of transparency to convey the x-ray vision concept while maintaining the integrity of the car. Partially because of the right tail light being covered by him, and the victim being in the middle of the car, the car looks way narrower than it should. I would say this is a very successful image.</td>', 'Not a very exciting image, but very nicely done - just the right amount of transparency to convey the x-ray vision concept while maintaining the integrity of the car. Partially because of the right tail light being covered by him, and the victim being in the middle of the car, the car looks way narrower than it should. I would say this is a very successful image.', '2011-06-03 20:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433511, 953813, 77196, '<td valign="top">Absolutely awesome! Love the oversized "Saturn", and the star field. Lighting on the lake/forest/observers/wall/rock/path is great. Night sky is fantastic. Definitely a stand-out image.</td>', 'Absolutely awesome! Love the oversized "Saturn", and the star field. Lighting on the lake/forest/observers/wall/rock/path is great. Night sky is fantastic. Definitely a stand-out image.', '2011-06-03 20:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433512, 954999, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very nice image - wonderful sky, blue/red highlights. Something bothers me about the locations &amp; angles of the ship and the dual planets - too close, maybe, the ship wants to be pointing more at the viewer (like it is coming at them), maybe.</td>', 'Very nice image - wonderful sky, blue/red highlights. Something bothers me about the locations & angles of the ship and the dual planets - too close, maybe, the ship wants to be pointing more at the viewer (like it is coming at them), maybe.', '2011-06-03 20:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433515, 954483, 77196, '<td valign="top">Technically, this is very well done, but from the end of her nose through her neck just doesn''t work. There is such a strong attention draw to her eyes and the center of the splash, and leading lines from there downwards to nothing. That''s disturbing enough, but add in the wild colors (yeah, blue, red, and yellow - I get it)... nyet!</td>', 'Technically, this is very well done, but from the end of her nose through her neck just doesn''t work. There is such a strong attention draw to her eyes and the center of the splash, and leading lines from there downwards to nothing. That''s disturbing enough, but add in the wild colors (yeah, blue, red, and yellow - I get it)... nyet!', '2011-06-03 20:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433517, 954862, 77196, '<td valign="top">I feel there is much more you could have done with this in Expert Editing. Flying cows? Flatulent cows powering the windmills? skewered cows? Kind-of a weird horizontal line between the ground and the sky too. Were the windmills turning? Some look like they only have two of the three blades.</td>', 'I feel there is much more you could have done with this in Expert Editing. Flying cows? Flatulent cows powering the windmills? skewered cows? Kind-of a weird horizontal line between the ground and the sky too. Were the windmills turning? Some look like they only have two of the three blades.', '2011-06-03 20:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433519, 955082, 77196, '<td valign="top">Something isn''t working here with the direction of the lighting and proportions. Neat concept and well executed.</td>', 'Something isn''t working here with the direction of the lighting and proportions. Neat concept and well executed.', '2011-06-03 20:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433520, 955001, 77196, '<td valign="top">Too close to the all-black and all-brown square from a couple of years ago. However, your pixel does look to be crisply in focus, with nice contrast. A bit too centered of composition for my taste, however... ;-p</td>', 'Too close to the all-black and all-brown square from a couple of years ago. However, your pixel does look to be crisply in focus, with nice contrast. A bit too centered of composition for my taste, however... ;-p', '2011-06-03 20:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433521, 955083, 77196, '<td valign="top">OK. well done, but that fake eye is just weirding me out...</td>', 'OK. well done, but that fake eye is just weirding me out...', '2011-06-03 20:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433523, 955065, 77196, '<td valign="top">Cute idea, but the human face is a bit too subtle. I do hope people take a long enough look to give you good scores. I really like the colors in this, and the starfish do look like they''re dancing &amp; jumping.</td>', 'Cute idea, but the human face is a bit too subtle. I do hope people take a long enough look to give you good scores. I really like the colors in this, and the starfish do look like they''re dancing & jumping.', '2011-06-03 20:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433524, 955061, 77196, '<td valign="top">A bit creepy, but very emotive - could just as easily be other emotions as well. The grain and subtlety of contrast really make this picture. Love the reflected things in the windows (including the jet)</td>', 'A bit creepy, but very emotive - could just as easily be other emotions as well. The grain and subtlety of contrast really make this picture. Love the reflected things in the windows (including the jet)', '2011-06-03 20:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433525, 954991, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice hat!</td>', 'Nice hat!', '2011-06-03 20:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433530, 954303, 83686, '<td valign="top"><u></u></td>', '', '2011-06-03 20:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433531, 955077, 77196, '<td valign="top">Made me laugh</td>', 'Made me laugh', '2011-06-03 21:00:10.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6433538, 954867, 112739, '<td valign="top">Choices, choices life will bring, my whole life hanging by a string. A door or a window? By Sea or by Air? Only a bird would not care. My soul prepared for the trip, but for once I wish I owned a ship. The fateful step before me now is designed to test my core, for once I enter the abyss below, only then will my eternal soul I know. 9</td>', 'Choices, choices life will bring, my whole life hanging by a string. A door or a window? By Sea or by Air? Only a bird would not care. My soul prepared for the trip, but for once I wish I owned a ship. The fateful step before me now is designed to test my core, for once I enter the abyss below, only then will my eternal soul I know. 9', '2011-06-03 21:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433550, 954998, 112739, '<td valign="top">From the time I was a simple, happy, blossom, I feared the day of rapture. We all feared the rapture. Some tried to escape by splitting, others tried offensive tactics. I stayed with determined focus with my closest friend. Our cores were strong, and able to withstand the onslaught of endless battles, days and most nights. They tried to drill into our brains with automatic chewing machines, but we still stood strong. Determined to not be part of the inevitable harvest. We withstood all that came our way, and now, our legacy will be known once again when the rain falls and the sun shines down like tears from heaven.</td>', 'From the time I was a simple, happy, blossom, I feared the day of rapture. We all feared the rapture. Some tried to escape by splitting, others tried offensive tactics. I stayed with determined focus with my closest friend. Our cores were strong, and able to withstand the onslaught of endless battles, days and most nights. They tried to drill into our brains with automatic chewing machines, but we still stood strong. Determined to not be part of the inevitable harvest. We withstood all that came our way, and now, our legacy will be known once again when the rain falls and the sun shines down like tears from heaven.', '2011-06-03 21:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433556, 954983, 77196, '<td valign="top">No squirrels were harmed in the making of this picture... ;-p</td>', 'No squirrels were harmed in the making of this picture... ;-p', '2011-06-03 21:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433572, 954957, 111808, '<td valign="top">I absolutely LOVE this - it is my personal favourite of the entire challenge.<br/>It is surreal but it also makes perfect sense and it presents, sadly, an all too likely possible future scenario.</td>', 'I absolutely LOVE this - it is my personal favourite of the entire challenge.It is surreal but it also makes perfect sense and it presents, sadly, an all too likely possible future scenario.', '2011-06-03 22:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433579, 954434, 27812, '<td valign="top">10! This is what I yearn to learn more about!!!</td>', '10! This is what I yearn to learn more about!!!', '2011-06-03 22:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433598, 954867, 121949, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if I fully understand it, but really amazing work!</td>', 'I don''t know if I fully understand it, but really amazing work!', '2011-06-03 23:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433599, 954831, 121949, '<td valign="top">Very cool! One of my highest scores for this challenge.</td>', 'Very cool! One of my highest scores for this challenge.', '2011-06-03 23:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433600, 954321, 121949, '<td valign="top">This is creepy but cool, one of the best of the challenge.</td>', 'This is creepy but cool, one of the best of the challenge.', '2011-06-03 23:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433602, 955077, 121949, '<td valign="top">I thought this was a clever idea. The swimmer is just a tad on the cut and paste side but other wise a great image.</td>', 'I thought this was a clever idea. The swimmer is just a tad on the cut and paste side but other wise a great image.', '2011-06-03 23:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433604, 954937, 121949, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea, I like the way the figure in the mirror is looking right at us. I think it would have been better to just use a different older model for the reflection, (hard to do, I know) but it would have put it over the top for me.</td>', 'This is a great idea, I like the way the figure in the mirror is looking right at us. I think it would have been better to just use a different older model for the reflection, (hard to do, I know) but it would have put it over the top for me.', '2011-06-04 00:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433605, 954965, 121949, '<td valign="top">clever idea, the animals look just a little too cut and paste to me to be believable.</td>', 'clever idea, the animals look just a little too cut and paste to me to be believable.', '2011-06-04 00:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433607, 954483, 121949, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great idea combining all the things you see the most on DPC. You did an excellent job with her face, but the squarish outline of the hair bothers me some, I wish it was a more natural crop.</td>', 'I think this is a great idea combining all the things you see the most on DPC. You did an excellent job with her face, but the squarish outline of the hair bothers me some, I wish it was a more natural crop.', '2011-06-04 00:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433609, 955061, 112739, '<td valign="top">Tomorrow I will awake, as I always do, and yesterday will be in the record books for the lucky few. My future is uncertain as is most, but I remain positive to avoid the ghost. The day she departed, it was dawn, I can only pray that the past remain bygone. 9</td>', 'Tomorrow I will awake, as I always do, and yesterday will be in the record books for the lucky few. My future is uncertain as is most, but I remain positive to avoid the ghost. The day she departed, it was dawn, I can only pray that the past remain bygone. 9', '2011-06-04 00:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433610, 955081, 121949, '<td valign="top">I really like this idea, one of my top images. I can''t decide about the texture in the sky, I would like to see what it looks like without it. Like she is coming out of a door in the sky. Right now the sky almost looks like a wall, but maybe that was your intention.</td>', 'I really like this idea, one of my top images. I can''t decide about the texture in the sky, I would like to see what it looks like without it. Like she is coming out of a door in the sky. Right now the sky almost looks like a wall, but maybe that was your intention.', '2011-06-04 00:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433612, 954957, 123989, '<td valign="top">Very creative. Great shot.</td>', 'Very creative. Great shot.', '2011-06-04 00:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433631, 955080, 36843, '<td valign="top">interesting, hmmmmmmmm</td>', 'interesting, hmmmmmmmm', '2011-06-04 01:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433632, 954321, 36843, '<td valign="top">cool, yes never seen 7</td>', 'cool, yes never seen 7', '2011-06-04 01:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
