(6433702, 955079, 133206, '<td valign="top">:) Nice photo.</td>', ':) Nice photo.', '2011-06-04 06:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433703, 955018, 133206, '<td valign="top">:) very nice title. very creative.. Good work</td>', ':) very nice title. very creative.. Good work', '2011-06-04 06:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433705, 953993, 133206, '<td valign="top">nice photo</td>', 'nice photo', '2011-06-04 06:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433707, 954957, 133206, '<td valign="top">Nice</td>', 'Nice', '2011-06-04 06:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433722, 955001, 132021, '<td valign="top">Oh my god, I''m giving this a seven event though the rule-hounds are going to be all over it. If you had only taken some image, and burned every pixel out except for that one in the center. I have a feeling the "at least 160 pixels, and no more than 800 pixels on each side" rule is going to hurt here.</td>', 'Oh my god, I''m giving this a seven event though the rule-hounds are going to be all over it. If you had only taken some image, and burned every pixel out except for that one in the center. I have a feeling the "at least 160 pixels, and no more than 800 pixels on each side" rule is going to hurt here.', '2011-06-04 08:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433778, 954042, 67152, '<td valign="top">love the colors and the lines</td>', 'love the colors and the lines', '2011-06-04 10:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433781, 954983, 67152, '<td valign="top">very funny</td>', 'very funny', '2011-06-04 10:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433783, 954867, 67152, '<td valign="top">not usually a fan of overt photoshopped style photo collages, but this is surprisingly good</td>', 'not usually a fan of overt photoshopped style photo collages, but this is surprisingly good', '2011-06-04 10:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433786, 954558, 67152, '<td valign="top">very creative image - one of the few ''manufactured'' images in the challenge that actually say something</td>', 'very creative image - one of the few ''manufactured'' images in the challenge that actually say something', '2011-06-04 10:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433787, 954957, 67152, '<td valign="top">very funny and creepy all at the same time</td>', 'very funny and creepy all at the same time', '2011-06-04 10:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433788, 955021, 67152, '<td valign="top">how the various scenes meld into one is so engaging - well done</td>', 'how the various scenes meld into one is so engaging - well done', '2011-06-04 10:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433790, 954634, 67152, '<td valign="top">love this - such a quirky spot</td>', 'love this - such a quirky spot', '2011-06-04 10:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433791, 954991, 67152, '<td valign="top">love the reflection in the glasses</td>', 'love the reflection in the glasses', '2011-06-04 10:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433792, 954956, 67152, '<td valign="top">lovely</td>', 'lovely', '2011-06-04 10:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433873, 954434, 124815, '<td valign="top">We all get to be a little envious now. Yes, I would like more greens in MY little universe, a more charming house, perhaps a cow or a few sheep .... but boy, what a nice photo this is! You did a wonderful job and get the highest mark.</td>', 'We all get to be a little envious now. Yes, I would like more greens in MY little universe, a more charming house, perhaps a cow or a few sheep .... but boy, what a nice photo this is! You did a wonderful job and get the highest mark.', '2011-06-04 12:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433877, 955083, 124815, '<td valign="top">A lot of good work here but IMHO it does not convey what I think was the intended message. <br/>This is a heavily mauled dog that asks more for pity than instills fear or promotes nightmares. With a more precise focal point I would have given this image an 8 but I feel all confused and sadden by the image and by a shot not having reached its potential. 6</td>', 'A lot of good work here but IMHO it does not convey what I think was the intended message. This is a heavily mauled dog that asks more for pity than instills fear or promotes nightmares. With a more precise focal point I would have given this image an 8 but I feel all confused and sadden by the image and by a shot not having reached its potential. 6', '2011-06-04 13:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433878, 955081, 124815, '<td valign="top">A nice illustration more than a photo</td>', 'A nice illustration more than a photo', '2011-06-04 13:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433879, 954957, 124815, '<td valign="top">You just got it all in this picture! And so economically from the processing point of view! 10</td>', 'You just got it all in this picture! And so economically from the processing point of view! 10', '2011-06-04 13:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433882, 954964, 124815, '<td valign="top">A solid graphic image. But not a photograph any more IMO. A splendid page of a book.</td>', 'A solid graphic image. But not a photograph any more IMO. A splendid page of a book.', '2011-06-04 13:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433885, 955061, 124815, '<td valign="top">With this picture we are forced to admit: what a beauty this is! <br/>I am not sure that it was never seen on DPC (since I think I can attribute to a person and a school of thoughts) but it is a great image. First page. Will come back with a more precise prediction.</td>', 'With this picture we are forced to admit: what a beauty this is! I am not sure that it was never seen on DPC (since I think I can attribute to a person and a school of thoughts) but it is a great image. First page. Will come back with a more precise prediction.', '2011-06-04 13:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433886, 954971, 124815, '<td valign="top">Totally charming!</td>', 'Totally charming!', '2011-06-04 13:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433887, 955035, 124815, '<td valign="top">GREAT image! I am temporarily at a loss for words. First page stuff. And a 10.</td>', 'GREAT image! I am temporarily at a loss for words. First page stuff. And a 10.', '2011-06-04 13:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433888, 954575, 124815, '<td valign="top">Quadricycle.<br/>At the fine edge between dream and obsessive nightmare. Very, very good. <br/>I would have trimmed the sides at the dark point of the columns to choke the image more. <br/>Belongs to a movie that was not made yet. 9</td>', 'Quadricycle.At the fine edge between dream and obsessive nightmare. Very, very good. I would have trimmed the sides at the dark point of the columns to choke the image more. Belongs to a movie that was not made yet. 9', '2011-06-04 13:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433892, 955037, 124815, '<td valign="top">Great idea. Excellent picture.<br/>The border does not add one thing to this image IMO. Perhaps if the balloon string would have stopped there?<br/>But that''s a detail. <br/>You are in my top 10 for now, before getting more precise!</td>', 'Great idea. Excellent picture.The border does not add one thing to this image IMO. Perhaps if the balloon string would have stopped there?But that''s a detail. You are in my top 10 for now, before getting more precise!', '2011-06-04 13:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433894, 955015, 124815, '<td valign="top">I take your word for being a cat. <br/>For me it''s more like the last straw that broke the camel''s back. <br/>I like this image a lot although I do not think that it was never seen on DPC. <br/>It has a great rhythm and I can almost hear a screeching sound.</td>', 'I take your word for being a cat. For me it''s more like the last straw that broke the camel''s back. I like this image a lot although I do not think that it was never seen on DPC. It has a great rhythm and I can almost hear a screeching sound.', '2011-06-04 13:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433895, 955082, 124815, '<td valign="top">This is so comical and good-hearted that it cannot go unnoticed!</td>', 'This is so comical and good-hearted that it cannot go unnoticed!', '2011-06-04 13:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433900, 953813, 124815, '<td valign="top">This is a charming digital art illustration.</td>', 'This is a charming digital art illustration.', '2011-06-04 13:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433903, 955067, 124815, '<td valign="top">A lovely image. <br/>But as the story goes, I am not surprised that Apollo fell in love with irresistible Daphne, but he is supposed to be a real kuros, as beautiful and bright as sunlight and here he is a sort of unskillful, stocky and graceless man. Independently of the myth, I still mind the left figure (especially his left leg and hand). Should have melted in the foliage more.<br/>Nevertheless, it is a first page picture.</td>', 'A lovely image. But as the story goes, I am not surprised that Apollo fell in love with irresistible Daphne, but he is supposed to be a real kuros, as beautiful and bright as sunlight and here he is a sort of unskillful, stocky and graceless man. Independently of the myth, I still mind the left figure (especially his left leg and hand). Should have melted in the foliage more.Nevertheless, it is a first page picture.', '2011-06-04 13:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433905, 954303, 124815, '<td valign="top">The sky here got its money worth! <br/>But a very interesting and well planned image.</td>', 'The sky here got its money worth! But a very interesting and well planned image.', '2011-06-04 13:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433907, 955034, 124815, '<td valign="top">A lot of skillful work here but so slick and so illustrative that it really falls into the deja vu images. <br/>Masterly work though.</td>', 'A lot of skillful work here but so slick and so illustrative that it really falls into the deja vu images. Masterly work though.', '2011-06-04 14:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433908, 954831, 124815, '<td valign="top">So much good technical work here but the image is an illustration that I do not find particularly novel.</td>', 'So much good technical work here but the image is an illustration that I do not find particularly novel.', '2011-06-04 14:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433912, 954965, 124815, '<td valign="top">Good idea, great skill applied but so crowded and even!</td>', 'Good idea, great skill applied but so crowded and even!', '2011-06-04 14:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433914, 954945, 124815, '<td valign="top">Another spectacularly skillful picture but so post Dali-esque that IMHO it falls into a too much seen and exploited image. Very impressive work though.</td>', 'Another spectacularly skillful picture but so post Dali-esque that IMHO it falls into a too much seen and exploited image. Very impressive work though.', '2011-06-04 14:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433917, 954321, 124815, '<td valign="top">I keep looking at this picture and I appreciate the great work and idea. <br/>But there is something that repels me so much. And it has to do with the expression of the statue, with the treatment of its left eye and nose. When I cover the right side of the image it''s so much better. <br/>It''s a very personal opinion or idiosyncrasy of mine. <br/>Remains though a great image.</td>', 'I keep looking at this picture and I appreciate the great work and idea. But there is something that repels me so much. And it has to do with the expression of the statue, with the treatment of its left eye and nose. When I cover the right side of the image it''s so much better. It''s a very personal opinion or idiosyncrasy of mine. Remains though a great image.', '2011-06-04 14:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433920, 954977, 124815, '<td valign="top">A little undefined. Wish you had some detail in the foreground.</td>', 'A little undefined. Wish you had some detail in the foreground.', '2011-06-04 14:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433947, 954679, 124815, '<td valign="top">This is the first image to pop when I start looking at the challenge and absorbed me completely. It set the tone. So little fuss, just some blur and curves and we get to weave an entire story. First page stuff.</td>', 'This is the first image to pop when I start looking at the challenge and absorbed me completely. It set the tone. So little fuss, just some blur and curves and we get to weave an entire story. First page stuff.', '2011-06-04 14:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433969, 955023, 86447, '<td valign="top">Ha!   Fabulously done!   (not voting)</td>', 'Ha!   Fabulously done!   (not voting)', '2011-06-04 16:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
