(6436434, 955078, 60862, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but there are loads of shots of waves and surfers on DPC.  Even green waves.</td>', 'I''m sorry, but there are loads of shots of waves and surfers on DPC.  Even green waves.', '2011-06-07 00:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
