(6437067, 955081, 112739, '<td valign="top">My mother told me not to open the door, that there would be trouble. Had I minded her, I would not have discovered this monsterous, mysterious bubble. It lay there floating on the water, wanting, inviting attention. All I could do was stare in amazement from my point of detention. (nice work with combining all the elements)</td>', 'My mother told me not to open the door, that there would be trouble. Had I minded her, I would not have discovered this monsterous, mysterious bubble. It lay there floating on the water, wanting, inviting attention. All I could do was stare in amazement from my point of detention. (nice work with combining all the elements)', '2011-06-07 14:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6437091, 955023, 112739, '<td valign="top">This just makes me laugh and laugh. Love it, love it. 10<br/> <br/>Ok, I have been inspired by all the great works in this challenge, and I have been leaving story/poems as comments on some of them. This one deserves that as well. I didn''t enter, so this was my way of inserting some creative energy.<br/> <br/>Hours and hours of fun in the sun. Flowers and flowers as far as the eye can see, but no sign of a single bee. We kids borrowed my fathers glass and ladder, hoping he would not become madder. Climbing, laughing, jumping, over and over again, till the sun shone no more. Tomorrow a new day will begin again, what new wonders will be waiting for us kids to explore?</td>', 'This just makes me laugh and laugh. Love it, love it. 10 Ok, I have been inspired by all the great works in this challenge, and I have been leaving story/poems as comments on some of them. This one deserves that as well. I didn''t enter, so this was my way of inserting some creative energy. Hours and hours of fun in the sun. Flowers and flowers as far as the eye can see, but no sign of a single bee. We kids borrowed my fathers glass and ladder, hoping he would not become madder. Climbing, laughing, jumping, over and over again, till the sun shone no more. Tomorrow a new day will begin again, what new wonders will be waiting for us kids to explore?', '2011-06-07 15:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6437147, 955082, 112972, '<td valign="top">Haha, this is awesome!</td>', 'Haha, this is awesome!', '2011-06-07 16:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6437150, 955023, 112972, '<td valign="top">Just like in a fantasyland, beautiful!  Best in challenge!</td>', 'Just like in a fantasyland, beautiful!  Best in challenge!', '2011-06-07 16:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
