(6438595, 954945, 120058, '<td valign="top">I do feel that I have to explain my low score here, and apologise for it. <br/> <br/>It is a really cool picture, creds for that! The portrait behind the, eh, spattering blob seems to be really good as well But the blobsplatter? Not for me It makes her face look all grotesque and disgusting, and not flattering at all. The fact that the shoulder hasn''t got the same ''liquidy'' finish to it is really annoying as well, and the ''splatter'' looks very half-done, especially since it''s got some kind of chrome effect towards the end of the splatter and some kind of plastic wrap effect over half the shoulder and face. <br/> <br/>This is a 4 for me. Sorry.</td>', 'I do feel that I have to explain my low score here, and apologise for it.  It is a really cool picture, creds for that! The portrait behind the, eh, spattering blob seems to be really good as well But the blobsplatter? Not for me It makes her face look all grotesque and disgusting, and not flattering at all. The fact that the shoulder hasn''t got the same ''liquidy'' finish to it is really annoying as well, and the ''splatter'' looks very half-done, especially since it''s got some kind of chrome effect towards the end of the splatter and some kind of plastic wrap effect over half the shoulder and face.  This is a 4 for me. Sorry.', '2011-06-08 13:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
