(6439446, 954965, 103142, '<td valign="top">It''s a fun idea, but the lighting is different on everything, so they don''t fit together. The pigeon has a shadow going out to the right, but the light on the lion is coming from the opposite direction. The lion has no shadow. The lemurs and the gorilla are very flat. You might have done better sticking with the lion, flipping him so the light was coming from a better direction and adding a shadow. He fits best into the scene. Nicely done on the selections, though.</td>', 'It''s a fun idea, but the lighting is different on everything, so they don''t fit together. The pigeon has a shadow going out to the right, but the light on the lion is coming from the opposite direction. The lion has no shadow. The lemurs and the gorilla are very flat. You might have done better sticking with the lion, flipping him so the light was coming from a better direction and adding a shadow. He fits best into the scene. Nicely done on the selections, though.', '2011-06-09 10:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
