(6440302, 953826, 54446, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Art Roflmao:</b></div><hr/><i> Oh for pete''s sake, Richard - the score had WAYYY more to do with the fact that there are MANY photos of deer/elk/wildlife on DPC and nearly nothing to do with the editing. Look at the blue ribbon winner. Just because you think it meets the challenge doesn''t mean <strike>every</strike>anyone else does. ..."period".<br/> <br/>eta: I forgot to end on a positive note: It is a really great photo of a newborn elk, I''ll give you that. :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/>First and only newborn elk.  This is not a sub 5 image.  Does meet the challenge description.  Voted low because it''s not a cartoon collage.  It''s okay.  The entry was an experiment.  But, this is a unique photo.  Most of the entries in this challenge are not unique in any way, other than their degree of post processing.</td>', 'Originally posted by Art Roflmao: Oh for pete''s sake, Richard - the score had WAYYY more to do with the fact that there are MANY photos of deer/elk/wildlife on DPC and nearly nothing to do with the editing. Look at the blue ribbon winner. Just because you think it meets the challenge doesn''t mean everyanyone else does. ..."period". eta: I forgot to end on a positive note: It is a really great photo of a newborn elk, I''ll give you that. :)  First and only newborn elk.  This is not a sub 5 image.  Does meet the challenge description.  Voted low because it''s not a cartoon collage.  It''s okay.  The entry was an experiment.  But, this is a unique photo.  Most of the entries in this challenge are not unique in any way, other than their degree of post processing.', '2011-06-10 08:38:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(6440306, 953944, 132021, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for the votes and especially the nice comments!</td>', 'Thanks everyone for the votes and especially the nice comments!', '2011-06-10 08:48:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(6440307, 954831, 67152, '<td valign="top">Very pretty Judi - the surreal feel of this works well.  <br/> <br/>I just wonder if a slightly different pose on Kita in the background image would have worked better to give this a more completed look.  The one of her dead center and then the one to the left appear very similar (if not the same)</td>', 'Very pretty Judi - the surreal feel of this works well.   I just wonder if a slightly different pose on Kita in the background image would have worked better to give this a more completed look.  The one of her dead center and then the one to the left appear very similar (if not the same)', '2011-06-10 08:52:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(6440308, 954983, 79174, '<td valign="top">I LOVE the squirrel shots!  No need to apologize.  In fact, if you had not mentioned, or received comments on, the thousands of squirrel shots you have apparently submitted :) I would not have likely checked out your other work, which is equally as great!  Now that you have created a side niche on Squirrels, I think you should now proudly own that space.  Keep ''em coming!  I love them and I think you do a great job working them!  (do the other stuff too)</td>', 'I LOVE the squirrel shots!  No need to apologize.  In fact, if you had not mentioned, or received comments on, the thousands of squirrel shots you have apparently submitted :) I would not have likely checked out your other work, which is equally as great!  Now that you have created a side niche on Squirrels, I think you should now proudly own that space.  Keep ''em coming!  I love them and I think you do a great job working them!  (do the other stuff too)', '2011-06-10 08:52:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(6440316, 953829, 67152, '<td valign="top">Coffee and coffee machines have been on DPC before.  You need to learn how to search on the site...so in a word your photo does not meet challenge.<br/> <br/>For the photo, the image is unappealing, sloppily composed, and uninteresting as if no effort was taken - just like the title with the mispelling.</td>', 'Coffee and coffee machines have been on DPC before.  You need to learn how to search on the site...so in a word your photo does not meet challenge. For the photo, the image is unappealing, sloppily composed, and uninteresting as if no effort was taken - just like the title with the mispelling.', '2011-06-10 09:02:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(6440323, 954957, 49109, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your win and great score, good to see an "advanced editing" image (and such an excellent one to boot) wins this challenge. Goes to show that most of the "expert" images are way overdone and a good idea accomplished with good technicals is what really makes an outstanding shot.</td>', 'Congrats on your win and great score, good to see an "advanced editing" image (and such an excellent one to boot) wins this challenge. Goes to show that most of the "expert" images are way overdone and a good idea accomplished with good technicals is what really makes an outstanding shot.', '2011-06-10 09:06:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(6440338, 954957, 19944, '<td valign="top">I usually am not a fan of some of the stuff that places high in expert editing challenges.  To me, they are not so much photographs as they are graphic creations (not to say they aren''t well done....for what they are).<br/> <br/>It''s good to see an actual photograph (apparently with not a ton of editing) win an challenge against the creations.</td>', 'I usually am not a fan of some of the stuff that places high in expert editing challenges.  To me, they are not so much photographs as they are graphic creations (not to say they aren''t well done....for what they are). It''s good to see an actual photograph (apparently with not a ton of editing) win an challenge against the creations.', '2011-06-10 09:19:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(6440346, 953929, 100831, '<td valign="top">The family unit. I love the way you carved them out and pieced them back together. Life is a puzzle, isn''t it?<br/></td>', 'The family unit. I love the way you carved them out and pieced them back together. Life is a puzzle, isn''t it?', '2011-06-10 09:31:16.000000', NULL, 0),
