 in the title.  I didn''t vote on it but thought it was a scrawny deer.  Ok, ok... possibly substituting a godzilla head wouldn''t hurt either ;-)  No, I''m not silly.  As you indicate in your comments, no one has seen a newborn elk run.  Twice as big as a deer fawn, btw.  Hey, it''s okay.  I just entered this challenge to prove that people are voting on the processing, not on an image which meets the challenge. ', '2011-06-11 00:07:35.000000', '2011-06-11 00:13:20.000000', 0),
