(6441158, 954957, 39057, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=954483" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1398/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_954483.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1398/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_954483.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1398/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_954483.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>From your comments it looks like you were going for the reduction in available water in the world. However, when I saw it, I thought you were going for the theme that I was going for in my DQ entry....making light of all the water drop photos on DPC. I wonder how many others thought the same?<br/> <br/>Good job. I gave this an 8.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-06-11 09:37:56.</i></td>', '  From your comments it looks like you were going for the reduction in available water in the world. However, when I saw it, I thought you were going for the theme that I was going for in my DQ entry....making light of all the water drop photos on DPC. I wonder how many others thought the same? Good job. I gave this an 8.', '2011-06-11 10:36:24.000000', '2011-06-11 10:37:56.000000', 0),
