(6441380, 955061, 35804, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ubique:</b></div><hr/><i> Fizzzzzzzzzzzz!  It fizzzzes, Rachel.  Electrically, emotionally, intellectually lovely.  I''m in one of my regular DPC hiatus phases so I didn''t vote nor even look, but given that I think that DPC scores are pretty conclusively antithetical anyway I can say that I really admire this picture.  It was one of the two most interesting and demanding entries, without any question.  I''m not too sure who Karen is, but I''ll bet she agrees with me as well. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>...maybe Clive was just being obscure...Clive the Obscure...or drunk...</td>', 'Originally posted by ubique: Fizzzzzzzzzzzz!  It fizzzzes, Rachel.  Electrically, emotionally, intellectually lovely.  I''m in one of my regular DPC hiatus phases so I didn''t vote nor even look, but given that I think that DPC scores are pretty conclusively antithetical anyway I can say that I really admire this picture.  It was one of the two most interesting and demanding entries, without any question.  I''m not too sure who Karen is, but I''ll bet she agrees with me as well.   ...maybe Clive was just being obscure...Clive the Obscure...or drunk...', '2011-06-11 18:32:52.000000', NULL, 0),
