(6443937, 953829, 132177, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bassbone:</b></div><hr/><i> Coffee and coffee machines have been on DPC before.  You need to learn how to search on the site...so in a word your photo does not meet challenge.<br/> <br/>For the photo, the image is unappealing, sloppily composed, and uninteresting as if no effort was taken - just like the title with the mispelling. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for your negative and destroying comments. Due to your anger I much more appreciate my photo. With respect to the search in the database you simply do not understand. Coffe and coffe machine are in. Have u ever see a photo taken while, with a moka, the coffe is getting ready ? No, you never saw a photo of that moment .</td>', 'Originally posted by bassbone: Coffee and coffee machines have been on DPC before.  You need to learn how to search on the site...so in a word your photo does not meet challenge. For the photo, the image is unappealing, sloppily composed, and uninteresting as if no effort was taken - just like the title with the mispelling.   Thanks for your negative and destroying comments. Due to your anger I much more appreciate my photo. With respect to the search in the database you simply do not understand. Coffe and coffe machine are in. Have u ever see a photo taken while, with a moka, the coffe is getting ready ? No, you never saw a photo of that moment .', '2011-06-14 21:27:22.000000', NULL, 0),
